024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-07-29T20:05:03Z","updated_at":"2025-10-08T18:44:53Z","closed_at":"2025-08-04T17:08:36Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109095","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109095","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109095.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109095.patch","merged_at":"2025-08-04T17:08:35Z"},"body":"- Fixes godotengine/godot-docs#10896\r\n- Can be cherry picked back to 4.3\r\n\r\nAs pointed out in godotengine/godot-docs#10896, HDR 2D support was added to the Compatibility rendering method in #87360, but the docs weren't updated. This PR updates these docs.\r\n\r\nThe docs issue also points out that `get_texture().get_image().get_format()` returns `FORMAT_RGBAF` not `FORMAT_RGBAH`, but I believe that the actual framebuffer format is a 16-bit per channel format, even though the image format is a 32-bit format. (Please correct me if I'm wrong -- I've only [looked at the code that's located here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/71a9948157dc2d5cc71fcb456c9d96656678757d/drivers/gles3/storage/texture_storage.cpp#L2112-L2116) to form this belief and I do not yet have a good understanding of the difference between the `color_internal_format` and `image_format`.)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109095/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109095/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}